silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ThesisConcreteAnchorGraniteExample" .
silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'ThesisConcreteAnchorGranite', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the Granite closure tuple (B, chi, M, A, alpha, T, V) for the Tartu vet-clinic encyclopedia entry: source body, chunk extraction, manifest family, adapter family, fusion cocone, stabilized model, validation profile; also, the chunk extraction morphism that reads governed sections of B and produces typed chunks, e.g. extracting the Tartu vet-record passage from 02_mittens_anchor.tex lines 44-58; also, the family of chunk manifests produced for every typed chunk, including m_vet (manifest for the Tartu vet-record evidence chunk c-0x7f4a)." .
